What does "API Integration" mean?

Suppose your application needs customer information from another company.
Your application sends: GET /customers/101
The external system responds:
{
    "customer_id": 101,
    "name": "Arun Kumar",
    "city": "Chennai"
}
Your Python program receives this response and does something with it.
For example:
API
 ↓
Python
 ↓
Validate
 ↓
Transform
 ↓
Store in PostgreSQL

That complete process is API integration.
